{"sections":[{"slug":"PROP","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"PROP"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"PROP"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"PROP"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>PROP (product and permutation category, “<span lang=\"zh\">积</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">置换范畴</span>”) <span lang=\"zh\">是指所有对象均形如</span> $x^{\\otimes n}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">我们保留</span> PROP <span lang=\"zh\">这个名字是因为它的厚重历史</span>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Lawvere理论","text":"Lawvere <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span> PROP <span lang=\"zh\">的特殊情形</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">它的运算</span> $\\otimes$ <span lang=\"zh\">是范畴论</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/积(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">积</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>PROP <span lang=\"zh\">又可视为单色</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":": <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> PROP $\\mathcal P$, $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P}(x^{\\otimes n},x)$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成一个单色算畴的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">元运算</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">平凡运算</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">有限集与</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">双射</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">构成的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Fin}^{\\simeq}$ <span lang=\"zh\">配备不交并</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">构成一个平凡的</span> PROP, <span lang=\"zh\">它是一个对象生成的自由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">对任意对称幺半范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中的对象等同于对称幺半函子</span> $\\mathsf{Fin}^{\\simeq} \\to \\mathcal C$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">交换运算</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">有限集的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Fin}$ <span lang=\"zh\">配备</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/和(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余积</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是一个</span> PROP, <span lang=\"zh\">因为每个有限集都是有限个单点集的并</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这个</span> PROP <span lang=\"zh\">记录了</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/交换代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法</span>"}},{"Plain":": <span lang=\"zh\">对任意对称幺半范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中的交换代数等同于对称幺半函子</span> $\\mathsf{Fin} \\to \\mathcal C$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">结合运算</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑如下范畴</span> $\\mathcal S$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">其对象为有限集</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个集合映射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">配备每个点的原像</span> $f^{-1}(y)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全序集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全序</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这个范畴记录了对称幺半范畴中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的语法</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">任意对称幺半范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的结合代数等同于对称幺半函子</span> $\\mathcal S \\to \\mathcal C$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">小方块</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">如下</span> PROP <span lang=\"zh\">可视为</span> $\\mathsf{Top}$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">或</span> $(\\infty,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/小n-方块算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">小方块算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":":</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">其对象为若干方块</span> $[0,1]^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的无交并</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $f \\colon \\sqcup_k [0,1]^n \\to \\sqcup_m [0,1]^m$ <span lang=\"zh\">为横平竖直的嵌入</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">在每个</span> $[0,1]^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的限制均为缩放与平移的复合</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}